andomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nCai Wan looks forward to Christmas all year round, because she knows she can ask her parents for a rabbit at Christmas. Cai Wan wants a rabbit more than anything else in the world. Finally, Christmas comes, and Cai Wan runs to open the big box her parents give her. She is sure there is a little rabbit in a cage inside. However, when she opens it in front of all her family, she finds her gift is just a set of boring old encyclopedias, which Cai Wan does not want at all! However, when Cai Wan's parents ask her if she likes her Christmas gift, she says, \"It is very cute, thank you. This is exactly what I want.\"\n\n[Question]\nIs what Cai Wan says true?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. No\nB. Yes","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":6.263208840480507E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5924b9aa9dc5a833d74ee","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794478667281,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:17:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"1b62c88e995e4540b1daf527c6f72753"}